        "title": "Misinformation: Viral Spread, Prebunking, Fact-Checking, Platform Policy",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "\"The Spread of True and False News Online\"\n  Authors: Soroush Vosoughi, Deb Roy, Sinan Aral (MIT)\n  Data: all fact-checked Twitter content 2006-2017\n        ~126,000 rumor cascades\n        Verified claims from: Snopes, PolitiFact, FactCheck.org\n        3 million accounts, 4.5 million tweets"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-MISINFORMATION.md#010",
      "path": [
        "08-MISINFORMATION.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:digital-media:08-misinformation, git-history:digital-media:08-misinformation]",
