        "root_concepts": "[misinformation]",
        "section": "digital-media",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Misinformation: Viral Spread, Prebunking, Fact-Checking, Platform Policy",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "KEY FINDING:\n  False news spreads significantly faster, farther, deeper,\n  and more broadly than true news\n  FALSE news: 70% more likely to be retweeted than true\n  TRUE news: takes 6x longer to reach 1,500 people\n  FALSE news: reaches any depth of retweet cascade faster"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-MISINFORMATION.md#011",
      "path": [
        "08-MISINFORMATION.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
