        "id": "maxim:digital-media:misinformation",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "digital-media",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[misinformation]",
        "section": "digital-media",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Misinformation: Viral Spread, Prebunking, Fact-Checking, Platform Policy",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "1. NOVELTY (the main driver per MIT study):\n   Novel claims are more memorable and more shareable\n   True news tends to be incrementally novel\n   False news can be extremely novel (no factual constraint)\n   Novelty activates curiosity + sharing instinct"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-MISINFORMATION.md#017",
      "path": [
        "08-MISINFORMATION.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:digital-media:08-misinformation, git-history:digital-media:08-misinformation]",
        "canonical_path": "digital-media/08-MISINFORMATION.md",
        "concepts": "[misinformation]",
        "current_path": "digital-media/08-MISINFORMATION.md",
        "id": "maxim:digital-media:misinformation",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "digital-media",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[misinformation]",
        "section": "digital-media",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Misinformation: Viral Spread, Prebunking, Fact-Checking, Platform Policy",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "2. EMOTIONAL AROUSAL:\n   High-arousal emotions (fear, anger, disgust) drive sharing\n   Low-arousal emotions (sadness, contentment) do not\n   False news can optimize for emotional impact\n   True news is constrained by what actually happened"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-MISINFORMATION.md#018",
      "path": [
        "08-MISINFORMATION.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:digital-media:08-misinformation, git-history:digital-media:08-misinformation]",
