        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Misinformation: Viral Spread, Prebunking, Fact-Checking, Platform Policy",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "3. IDENTITY PROTECTIVE COGNITION (Dan Kahan):\n   People evaluate information for identity-consistency\n   not for epistemic accuracy\n   \"Does this confirm my group's view of the world?\"\n   -> Share if yes; scrutinize if no\n   -> Bypasses accuracy checking entirely"
    },
